encoding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-additive-connective\">df-additive-connective</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a> 的公式、多重集和规则集合，所有规则实例均保留该定义的旁条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Add}:=\\langle\\{\\oplus,\\mathbin{\\&amp;},\\mathbf0,\\top\\},R_\\oplus\\cup R_{\\&amp;}\\cup R_\\top\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Add}:=\\langle\\{\\oplus,\\mathbin{\\&amp;},\\mathbf0,\\top\\},R_\\oplus\\cup R_{\\&amp;}\\cup R_\\top\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规则是有前提序列与结论的有序对集合，非一个没有定义的可导性谓词。片段语法由有限构造迭代给出；指数节点指完整命题LL中!/?规则层，不把一般结构规则加回非指数公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-additive-connective","text":"df-additive-connective","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-linear-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-linear-logic]] 的公式、多重集和规则集合，所有规则实例均保留该定义的旁条件。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Add}:=\\langle\\{\\oplus,\\mathbin{\\&},\\mathbf0,\\top\\},R_\\oplus\\cup R_{\\&}\\cup R_\\top\\rangle.","display":true}],"bytes":1252,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-378","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-additive-connective|df-additive-connective — Additive Connective]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-376","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-additive-connective — Additive Connective](72-df-additive-connective.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-412","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-additive-connective|df-additive-connective — Additive Connective]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-additive-connective]]"}],"outgoing":["a70f24e0154f1736"]}